== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|r}} The [[Anti:Hardy|Hardy]] first appeared in the ''Antibirth'' mod where its third impact with an obstacle would cause the same effects as its first and second impact but also create rocks to fall from the ceiling.
* Squirts are likely a reference to [[zelda:Zol|Zols]], big Gels that split into two Gels upon death.

